  speakerName: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0fcb4f4247841f844a4ed3948dae66cf, type: 2}
  icon: {fileID: 0}
  portugueseText: "Era s\xF3 um dia comum. Mas algo aconteceu, e o mundo entrou em
    colapso, e nunca mais foi o mesmo. E neste dia, os irm\xE3os Marco e Rafael encontrariam
    algo que mudaria suas vidas completamente."
  englishText: It was just an ordinary day. But something happened, and the world
    collapsed, and it was never the same again. And on this day, brothers Marco and
    Rafael would find something that would change their lives completely.
